## Bottom Line

**For your research paper goal:**

✅ **Fine-tuning is sufficient** to demonstrate PAKD effectiveness  
✅ **Inference optimizations** (ACC, SCPD) work regardless of training method  
✅ **Faster to publication** with validated results  

**Consider full training only if:**
❌ Fine-tuning results are disappointing  
❌ You need architectural novelty claims  
❌ You have extra time and want stronger results  

**My advice:** Run the 2-week fine-tuning experiment. If it works, you have a paper. If it doesn't work, then reassess whether full training will help or if the methodology needs refinement.

